reaction "乙酸与碳酸氢钠反应"
equation "CH₃COOH + NaHCO₃ → CH₃COONa + CO₂↑ + H₂O"
summary "羧酸酸性强于碳酸氢根对应的碳酸，可发生放出CO₂的酸碱反应。"

step "酸碱反应物" {
  note "乙酸向HCO₃⁻转移质子。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom O4 O
  atom Na6 Na charge=+1
  atom O7 O
  atom C9 C
  atom O10 O
  atom O11 O charge=-1
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H4a H
  atom H7a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 2
  bond C2 O4 1
  bond O7 C9 1
  bond C9 O10 2
  bond C9 O11 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond O4 H4a 1
  bond O7 H7a 1
}

step "生成乙酸根与碳酸" {
  note "先形成乙酸根和碳酸，碳酸不稳定。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom O4 O charge=-1
  atom Na6 Na charge=+1
  atom O7 O
  atom C9 C
  atom O10 O
  atom O11 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H7a H
  atom H11a H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 2
  bond C2 O4 1
  bond O7 C9 1
  bond C9 O10 2
  bond C9 O11 1
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond O7 H7a 1
  bond O11 H11a 1
}

step "碳酸分解" {
  note "碳酸分解为CO₂和H₂O。考试重点：羧酸可与NaHCO₃放出CO₂，苯酚通常不能。"
  atom C1 C
  atom C2 C
  atom O3 O
  atom O4 O charge=-1
  atom Na6 Na charge=+1
  atom O10 O
  atom C9 C
  atom O7 O
  atom O11 O
  atom H1a H
  atom H1b H
  atom H1c H
  atom H11a H
  atom H11b H
  bond C1 C2 1
  bond C2 O3 2
  bond C2 O4 1
  bond O10 C9 2
  bond C9 O7 2
  bond C1 H1a 1
  bond C1 H1b 1
  bond C1 H1c 1
  bond O11 H11a 1
  bond O11 H11b 1
}
